.TH METADESK-CLIENT 1 "November 2026" "Metadesk 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
metadesk-client \- authenticated remote desktop video client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B metadesk-client
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Metadesk uses Nostr identities to authorize desktop sessions.
Configure an account and signer before starting a session.
Native packages use the distribution's FFmpeg libraries.
Optional Cisco OpenH264 must be obtained separately and is never bundled.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print the complete command-line options and exit without starting a session.
.SH FILES
Configuration and account state are stored in the user's XDG configuration directory.
No keys or account state are installed by this package.
.SH SECURITY
Do not expose an unauthenticated session or grant device access globally.
The systemd user unit is not enabled automatically.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR metadesk-host (1)
